<title>PHILIPPINES: Matsushita sets cash, stock dividends.</title>
<headline>Matsushita sets cash, stock dividends.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Matsushita Electric Philippines Corp said on Wednesday its board had approved a 20 centavo cash dividend and a 10 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>Shareholders as of May 30 will be eligible for the cash dividend which will be paid out on June 20, the company told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The stock dividend will be given to shareholders as of June 30.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
